# SPA fallback.
#
# Routing is client-side, so a direct request for /privacy, /terms or any
# other route is not a file on disk. Without this rule the host returns its
# own 404 for every deep link, shared URL and search-engine crawl of an
# inner page. The 200 (not 302) keeps the requested URL in the address bar
# so React Router can read it and render the right page.
/*  /index.html  200
